"P2638260464" "taskMission"
// IntroString :
"P53503012" "I have sensed a disturbance in the psychic energies about Nerva Archipelago. It's as if someone or something has generated a mental fog which blinds my extra-sensory perception. However, as a master psychic I have managed to pierce this veil enough to find the source of this psionic murk. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Find the source of this psychic fog and destroy it!</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


