// Name :
// IntroString :
"P2163219607" "Are you familiar with Psionium? It's a rare ore which can be processed to create a focus for psionic powers. The researchers over at the GIFT labs in Paragon City have been experimenting with Psionium. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Bring me the Psionium ore sample and research data!</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


